{"id":"850f86d5448feae4","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-definability.md","title":"真理可定义性","display":"df-truth-definability — 真理可定义性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-definability","aliases":["91-df-truth-definability"],"display":"df-truth-definability — 真理可定义性","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-ground-model]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-definability — 真理可定义性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"253f996295270684\" href=\"?note=253f996295270684\" title=\"91-df-ground-model\">91-df-ground-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-definability-—-真理可定义性-$\\mathrm{Defin}$\">df-truth-definability — 真理可定义性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defin}\">\\(\\mathrm{Defin}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> (标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>-结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (候选定义公式)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathcal N\\models\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal N\\models\\varphi\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathcal N\\models\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal N\\models\\varphi\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau)\\)</span>：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 在结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 中定义全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 真句子的编码</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理可定义性的含义：\n真理可定义性指存在基础语言公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x)\">\\(\\tau(x)\\)</span>，其在指定结构中的外延恰好是\n真句子的 Gödel 编码集。左右两边都是元层满足断言，不能把右侧公式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 裸放在模型满足符号之外。</p>\n<p>Tarski不可定义性定理（见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a>）：\n对足够表达算术句法的标准算术语言，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>真理可定义性与真理理论的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tarski定理表明真理不可在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>中定义</li>\n<li>真理理论通过引入新符号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>绕过此限制</li>\n<li>真理理论的公理化方法替代定义方法</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理可定义性的层次：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>可定义性</th>\n<th>证明能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>标准算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> 中定义其自身真理</td>\n<td>不可行</td>\n<td>Tarski 不可定义性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> 中加入原始谓词并公理化</td>\n<td>可行但不是显定义</td>\n<td>理论扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更高层元语言定义较低层真理</td>\n<td>在适当语义下可行</td>\n<td>层次真理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-definability-—-真理可定义性-$\\mathrm{Defin}$","text":"df-truth-definability — 真理可定义性 $\\mathrm{Defin}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-model","status":"resolved","id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Tarski不可定义性定理（见[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]）：\n对足够表达算术句法的标准算术语言，","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathcal N\\models\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal N\\models\\varphi\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}(\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}